<section id="references"><h2>Sources and further reading</h2><p>The article synthesizes historical testimony and research; it is not a literal translation of a historical source. The scholarly works below support the distinction between everyday rural history, nineteenth-century descriptions, and later cultural symbolism.</p><ul>
