<li><a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/abs/cambridge-history-of-latin-american-literature/gaucho-genre/11C314A9DE198E5081055141AB126635" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Josefina Ludmer, “The gaucho genre,” <em>The Cambridge History of Latin American Literature</em></a> — the literary genre and its oral and written traditions.</li>
<li><a href="https://www.anuarioiha.fahce.unlp.edu.ar/article/download/IHAe067/9638" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ezequiel Adamovsky (2018), “Criollismo, experiencia popular y política: el gaucho como emblema subversivo”</a> — social meanings of popular criollismo.</li>
